1
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:42,400
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:47,620
[Episode 24: I Love You
When the Wind Rises]

3
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:58,680
Nanfeng.

4
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:07,760
Stay calm.

5
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,120
Our qipaos are selling...

6
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,920
like crazy...

7
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:23,240
overseas!

8
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,320
You know what?

9
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,880
Orders from North America and Europe

10
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,200
are already booked through the second half
of the year.

11
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,420
And all the Hollywood actresses

12
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:30,420
are wearing our custom qipaos.

13
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,320
Fashion magazines have reported on it too.

14
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:34,400
They say Chinese qipaos

15
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,660
are sparking a global fashion craze.

16
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,479
You did it!

17
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,000
I... did it?

18
00:01:47,479 --> 00:01:49,280
Yes, you did it!

19
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,600
That's amazing!

20
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:55,000
My dream has finally come true!

21
00:02:10,110 --> 00:02:12,720
[Shencheng First Garment Factory]

22
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,610
Why did you bring me to the old factory?

23
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,000
Why...

24
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,490
Is there a surprise?

25
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,170
Turn around.

26
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,120
This is...

27
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,120
Mr. Chu Chunsheng,

28
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:08,080
for richer or poorer,

29
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,800
in good times or bad,

30
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:19,079
will you protect and stand by me forever?

31
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,760
Ms. Xie Nanfeng.

32
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:25,960
Speaking.

33
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,800
Are you willing to accept all of me

34
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,160
and walk beside me through life?

35
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:36,800
I do.

36
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:44,520
Kiss! Kiss!

37
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,750
Where do you want to go for our honeymoon?

38
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:13,190
Paris, New York, or Italy?

39
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,880
It's up to you.

40
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,240
I want to go to Harboria

41
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,339
to ring the bell at Nasdaq.

42
00:04:20,620 --> 00:04:23,300
And I want Fashion Flower

43
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,020
to go public overseas.

44
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:29,440
Looks like I married a goldmine, huh?

45
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:31,120
You sure did.

46
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:32,240
Look.

47
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:33,260
Look at that boat.

48
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:36,320
Biao!

49
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,600
Let's go over.

50
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,300
You two really hid this well, huh?

51
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,040
Sister-in-law.

52
00:04:52,159 --> 00:04:54,320
Zhi wants to start her own business,

53
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:56,060
but she can't bear to leave you.

54
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,100
Stop talking.

55
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:58,840
Ms. Xie.

56
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:00,450
I'm sorry.

57
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,040
I may have to leave you.

58
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:06,070
I just want to see what I'm capable of.

59
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,840
Zhi,

60
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,440
did you forget

61
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,920
what I told you before?

62
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,640
I'm training you

63
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,720
not to keep you by my side,

64
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:20,480
but because I hope
you can take what you've learned

65
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:23,400
and make a bigger world
for yourself out there.

66
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,440
Ms. Xie.

67
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:29,120
Thank you.

68
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,320
For what?

69
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,440
I'll invest in your project in the future.

70
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,520
No matter what difficulties you encounter,

71
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,650
I will always be here

72
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,480
waiting for you to come back.

73
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,320
Then it's a promise, Ms. Xie.

74
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:49,120
You'll be Zhi's
major shareholder from now on.

75
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:52,040
We are going to Hangzhou

76
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:55,080
to start an internet business
with her classmates.

77
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,320
We even have a name.

78
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,720
Alababa.

79
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,240
Alababa?

80
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,440
So,

81
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,120
you're going too?

82
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,720
Well...

83
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,720
Didn't I learn this from you?

84
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,080
To be the successful man

85
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,610
behind a successful woman.

86
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,680
All right.

87
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:20,410
Off you go.

88
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:22,040
We'll come back to visit you.

89
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,480
Go on.

90
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,200
Let's go!

91
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,520
Got it!

92
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,040
This generation of Shenchenese

93
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:48,370
were never just pushed along by the times.

94
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,840
When the tides surged,

95
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,880
we held the helm tightly in our hands.

96
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:54,960
Those storms and glories

97
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,640
will ultimately

98
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,080
become

99
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,440
the most vivid marks

100
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,820
etched into the history of this city.

101
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:31,920
Madam.

102
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,320
The mainland stock market
is just starting out.

103
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,840
The system isn't mature yet.

104
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:36,970
Why take such a risk?

105
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,120
Only big storms

106
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:42,090
bring big opportunities.

107
00:07:58,150 --> 00:07:59,380
[Nantou Ancient City Museum]

108
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,200
The winds of Reform and Opening Up

109
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,840
have never favored anyone.

110
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,720
They simply gave

111
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,720
gave everyone who dared to dream

112
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,160
a ticket to the voyage.

113
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,820
And the vast sea that is Shencheng

114
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,440
has room for everyone who sets sail.

115
00:08:27,590 --> 00:08:30,660
[The End]
